{"id":"2f12f36e10770cfc","group":"29","path":"29/29-df-simultaneous-iteration.md","title":"同时一阶关系迭代","display":"df-simultaneous-iteration — 同时一阶关系迭代","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-df-simultaneous-iteration","aliases":["29-df-simultaneous-iteration"],"display":"df-simultaneous-iteration — 同时一阶关系迭代","depends_on":["[[29-df-struc]]","[[29-df-formula]]","[[29-df-free-variable]]","[[29-df-variable]]","[[29-df-satisfaction]]"],"source_locator":"Definition 10.9; Example 10.11, pp.160–161, DjVu scans 175–176","source_basis":"原书文本层与扫描图175–176；初态和读出接口为本地显式展开"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-df-simultaneous-iteration"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-df-simultaneous-iteration</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-simultaneous-iteration — 同时一阶关系迭代"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4de8e0c8085801f5\" href=\"?note=4de8e0c8085801f5\" title=\"29-df-struc\">29-df-struc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a3fa1d78e657e6a2\" href=\"?note=a3fa1d78e657e6a2\" title=\"29-df-formula\">29-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"db2b32546860e623\" href=\"?note=db2b32546860e623\" title=\"29-df-free-variable\">29-df-free-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ad08b66c5e54a436\" href=\"?note=ad08b66c5e54a436\" title=\"29-df-variable\">29-df-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3ee556c64b16809b\" href=\"?note=3ee556c64b16809b\" title=\"29-df-satisfaction\">29-df-satisfaction</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Definition 10.9; Example 10.11, pp.160–161, DjVu scans 175–176"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"原书文本层与扫描图175–176；初态和读出接口为本地显式展开"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 为有限关系词汇，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m,k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\">\\(m,k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho=\\langle R_1^{(k)},\\ldots,R_m^{(k)}\\rangle\">\\(\\rho=\\langle R_1^{(k)},\\ldots,R_m^{(k)}\\rangle\\)</span> 为与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 不交的不同关系符号组。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar x=(x_1,\\ldots,x_k)\">\\(\\bar x=(x_1,\\ldots,x_k)\\)</span> 分量各异；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\boldsymbol\\eta=(\\eta_1,\\ldots,\\eta_m)\">\\(\\boldsymbol\\eta=(\\eta_1,\\ldots,\\eta_m)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\boldsymbol\\varphi=(\\varphi_1,\\ldots,\\varphi_m)\">\\(\\boldsymbol\\varphi=(\\varphi_1,\\ldots,\\varphi_m)\\)</span> 分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\\cup\\rho\">\\(\\tau\\cup\\rho\\)</span> 上的一阶公式组，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}(\\eta_j),\\mathrm{FV}(\\varphi_j)\\subseteq\\{x_1,\\ldots,x_k\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}(\\eta_j),\\mathrm{FV}(\\varphi_j)\\subseteq\\{x_1,\\ldots,x_k\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\tau\\cup\\rho}\">\\(\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\tau\\cup\\rho}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}(\\theta)=\\varnothing\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}(\\theta)=\\varnothing\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal I=(\\rho,\\bar x,\\boldsymbol\\eta,\\boldsymbol\\varphi,\\theta)\">\\(\\mathcal I=(\\rho,\\bar x,\\boldsymbol\\eta,\\boldsymbol\\varphi,\\theta)\\)</span>。满足关系及自由变量分别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"3ee556c64b16809b\" href=\"?note=3ee556c64b16809b\" title=\"29-df-satisfaction\">29-df-satisfaction</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"db2b32546860e623\" href=\"?note=db2b32546860e623\" title=\"29-df-free-variable\">29-df-free-variable</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf X=(X_1,\\ldots,X_m)\\in\\mathcal P(|A|^k)^m\">\\(\\mathbf X=(X_1,\\ldots,X_m)\\in\\mathcal P(|A|^k)^m\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A[\\rho:=\\mathbf X]\">\\(A[\\rho:=\\mathbf X]\\)</span> 为保留 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 全部解释并增加 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_j^{A[\\rho:=\\mathbf X]}=X_j\">\\(R_j^{A[\\rho:=\\mathbf X]}=X_j\\)</span> 的扩张。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Sys}_{m,k}[\\tau]\\coloneqq\\left\\{(\\rho,\\bar x,\\boldsymbol\\eta,\\boldsymbol\\varphi,\\theta)\\ \\middle|\\ \\begin{aligned}&amp;\\rho=\\langle R_1^{(k)},\\ldots,R_m^{(k)}\\rangle,\\quad \\{R_1,\\ldots,R_m\\}\\cap\\tau=\\varnothing,\\quad |\\{R_1,\\ldots,R_m\\}|=m,\\\\&amp;\\bar x\\in\\mathrm{Var}^k,\\quad |\\{x_1,\\ldots,x_k\\}|=k,\\\\&amp;\\boldsymbol\\eta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_\\tau^m,\\quad\\boldsymbol\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\tau\\cup\\rho}^m,\\\\&amp;\\bigcup_{j=1}^m\\bigl(\\mathrm{FV}(\\eta_j)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}(\\varphi_j)\\bigr)\\subseteq\\{x_1,\\ldots,x_k\\},\\\\&amp;\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\tau\\cup\\rho},\\quad\\mathrm{FV}(\\theta)=\\varnothing\\end{aligned}\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Sys}_{m,k}[\\tau]\\coloneqq\\left\\{(\\rho,\\bar x,\\boldsymbol\\eta,\\boldsymbol\\varphi,\\theta)\\ \\middle|\\ \\begin{aligned}&amp;\\rho=\\langle R_1^{(k)},\\ldots,R_m^{(k)}\\rangle,\\quad \\{R_1,\\ldots,R_m\\}\\cap\\tau=\\varnothing,\\quad |\\{R_1,\\ldots,R_m\\}|=m,\\\\&amp;\\bar x\\in\\mathrm{Var}^k,\\quad |\\{x_1,\\ldots,x_k\\}|=k,\\\\&amp;\\boldsymbol\\eta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_\\tau^m,\\quad\\boldsymbol\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\tau\\cup\\rho}^m,\\\\&amp;\\bigcup_{j=1}^m\\bigl(\\mathrm{FV}(\\eta_j)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}(\\varphi_j)\\bigr)\\subseteq\\{x_1,\\ldots,x_k\\},\\\\&amp;\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\tau\\cup\\rho},\\quad\\mathrm{FV}(\\theta)=\\varnothing\\end{aligned}\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"F_{A,\\mathcal I}:\\mathcal P(|A|^k)^m\\to\\mathcal P(|A|^k)^m,\\qquad F_{A,\\mathcal I}(\\mathbf X)\\coloneqq\\left(\\{\\bar a\\in|A|^k\\mid A[\\rho:=\\mathbf X]\\models\\varphi_j[\\bar a/\\bar x]\\}\\right)_{j=1}^m.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[F_{A,\\mathcal I}:\\mathcal P(|A|^k)^m\\to\\mathcal P(|A|^k)^m,\\qquad F_{A,\\mathcal I}(\\mathbf X)\\coloneqq\\left(\\{\\bar a\\in|A|^k\\mid A[\\rho:=\\mathbf X]\\models\\varphi_j[\\bar a/\\bar x]\\}\\right)_{j=1}^m.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf X_0^{A,\\mathcal I}\\coloneqq\\left(\\{\\bar a\\in|A|^k\\mid A\\models\\eta_j[\\bar a/\\bar x]\\}\\right)_{j=1}^m,\\qquad\\mathbf X_{r+1}^{A,\\mathcal I}\\coloneqq F_{A,\\mathcal I}(\\mathbf X_r^{A,\\mathcal I}),\\quad r\\in\\mathbb N.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf X_0^{A,\\mathcal I}\\coloneqq\\left(\\{\\bar a\\in|A|^k\\mid A\\models\\eta_j[\\bar a/\\bar x]\\}\\right)_{j=1}^m,\\qquad\\mathbf X_{r+1}^{A,\\mathcal I}\\coloneqq F_{A,\\mathcal I}(\\mathbf X_r^{A,\\mathcal I}),\\quad r\\in\\mathbb N.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"o_{A,\\mathcal I}(r)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1,&amp;A[\\rho:=\\mathbf X_r^{A,\\mathcal I}]\\models\\theta,\\\\0,&amp;A[\\rho:=\\mathbf X_r^{A,\\mathcal I}]\\not\\models\\theta.\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[o_{A,\\mathcal I}(r)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1,&amp;A[\\rho:=\\mathbf X_r^{A,\\mathcal I}]\\models\\theta,\\\\0,&amp;A[\\rho:=\\mathbf X_r^{A,\\mathcal I}]\\not\\models\\theta.\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Definition 10.9，印刷页160、扫描页175，以及 Example 10.11，印刷页161、扫描页176；已查看两页原图。每轮的所有新关系都只读取上一轮完整状态，因此不是依次覆盖的原地更新。本条把书中省略的初态和布尔读出写为固定的一阶公式，属于显式接口约定；不要求更新公式正性。初态全空可取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta_j\\equiv\\neg(x_1=x_1)\">\\(\\eta_j\\equiv\\neg(x_1=x_1)\\)</span>。布尔状态可以用恒为空或恒为满的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 元关系表示，从而无需给现有正元数词汇接口增加零元关系。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-struc","status":"resolved","id":"4de8e0c8085801f5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-struc]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"a3fa1d78e657e6a2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"db2b32546860e623","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-free-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-variable","status":"resolved","id":"ad08b66c5e54a436","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"3ee556c64b16809b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-satisfaction","sta